# Repositories and working trees that live inside this one but are not its
# source. Prettier walks the filesystem, not the git index, so these are
# ordinary directories to it. Measured 2026-08-19: `prettier --check .` from
# the main checkout reported 88 files, 75 of them inside five other branches'
# working trees, which `--write` would have rewritten in place.
#   .worktrees/  — other branches, checked out via `git worktree`
#   .conclave/   — a separate git repository (agent memory + Conclave DATA)
#   .superpowers/ — git-ignored agent run artifacts
.worktrees
.conclave
.superpowers

# Third-party domain-ownership verification, served verbatim. Nothing in the
# repo explains its format and no reader here can, so it is left byte-for-byte
# as the vendor issued it rather than reformatted for a benefit of zero.
public/fo-verify.html

# design-sync lib forks — vendored copies of the skill's own lib/*.mjs, kept
# byte-comparable against upstream so re-syncs can diff and merge changes.
.design-sync/overrides

# Backup of the Claude Design project's hand-authored files. A backup that has
# been reformatted is no longer the thing it backs up — restoring it would push
# prettier's line breaks into a project this repo does not own. Same reason as
# .design-sync/overrides above: fidelity beats formatting.
designs/claude-design-project

# Instagram exports captured verbatim, and the fixture's own README says so:
# "Not changed: everything else. Class names, record order, date strings, the
# <base> tag, the 14.5 KB of inline CSS, whitespace". Handles were substituted;
# nothing else was. Prettier reflows markup, which moves where a text node
# splits — and `readRecords` accumulates text across nodes precisely because a
# parser may split anywhere, so a reformatted fixture would stop being evidence
# that the real bytes parse. Same rule as public/fo-verify.html above: these
# are captured evidence, not source. The pre-commit hook never saw them —
# lint-staged covers *.{ts,tsx} and *.{json,md}, not *.html — which is how they
# reached CI unformatted.
src/__tests__/fixtures/instagram-html/*.html
